# Pairs with ReshardCompletes. On reaching its target the coordinator clears
# its active flag without recording completion, so a reshard that started
# never reports complete. Fairness is unchanged.
MODULE: ReshardCompletesForgetsCompletion
TARGET: ReshardCompletes
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the reshard coordinator goes idle at its target instead of completing
PERTURBS: ReshardFinish

--- FIND
    /\ rmap = s2
    /\ rs' = "complete"
--- REPLACE
    /\ rmap = s2
\* MUTATION: completion is never recorded.
    /\ rs' = "idle"
--- END